                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "26c60ada-0785-413e-969f-ec390045b947",
                        "entry_id": "00f75cd0-c992-3458-923d-164197e1988e",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "form": "friands"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "4a930604-7775-44b9-afb2-c921bca63572",
                        "entry_id": "00f75cd0-c992-3458-923d-164197e1988e",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "friande"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "e8ec7f18-0473-4404-b424-0dbca018b059",
                        "entry_id": "00f75cd0-c992-3458-923d-164197e1988e",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "friandes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bec02843-f0dd-3df0-b174-e666b598cda4",
                        "entry_id": "00f75cd0-c992-3458-923d-164197e1988e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui aime la chère fine et délicate, et qui s’y connaît."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "da050955-487a-4128-bc25-7e69769e7b8c",
                                "sense_id": "bec02843-f0dd-3df0-b174-e666b598cda4",
                                "text": "Il n’est pas gourmand, mais il est friand."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a837ec27-2657-4346-8544-7395a62e97c6",
                                "sense_id": "bec02843-f0dd-3df0-b174-e666b598cda4",
                                "text": "Il est très friand de sucreries."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "88e7b4f5-2394-303c-b704-5763553e8971",
                        "entry_id": "00f75cd0-c992-3458-923d-164197e1988e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui manifeste de l'appétit."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d4885da-e462-4dd1-ab22-be6cb3835e73",
                                "sense_id": "88e7b4f5-2394-303c-b704-5763553e8971",
                                "text": "« Bon vin, » dit-il avec un friand clappement de langue contre le palais, puis il resta debout la main appuyée au rebord de la table, les yeux fixés sur le duc, attendant ce qu’on voulait de lui."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "04cb02c0-71e6-3695-8d07-7c9faa4c7548",
                        "entry_id": "00f75cd0-c992-3458-923d-164197e1988e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui aime beaucoup d’une chose et la recherche avec empressement."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "27a8b39f-ecda-4673-b461-3fb6193599fc",
                                "sense_id": "04cb02c0-71e6-3695-8d07-7c9faa4c7548",
                                "text": "Les odeurs forestières, senteurs adorées par les âmes friandes de poésie à qui plaisent les mousses les plus innocentes, les cryptogames les plus vénéneux, les terres mouillées, les saules, les baumes, le serpolet, les eaux vertes d’une mare, l’étoile arrondie des nénuphars jaunes ; toutes ces vigoureuses fécondations se livrent à vos narines en vous livrant toute une pensée, leur âme peut-être."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf949e9d-0968-4377-9de0-d781fa2dafbf",
                                "sense_id": "04cb02c0-71e6-3695-8d07-7c9faa4c7548",
                                "text": "Car, friande de ses propres lamentations, de ses gueulements, de son tragique inné, elle ne les souffrait pas d’autrui."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c68b791-d864-4abe-a23c-25e210984586",
                                "sense_id": "04cb02c0-71e6-3695-8d07-7c9faa4c7548",
                                "text": "Elle excelle aux tortillements, tour à tour fougueuse et alanguie, toujours disposée, experte en diable, friande de toutes les combinaisons."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8ea74b7-8814-4e3b-b67d-91342d454ce0",
                                "sense_id": "04cb02c0-71e6-3695-8d07-7c9faa4c7548",
                                "text": "Alors que je me plaignais de voir mes revenus ainsi régulés, on me fit savoir que cela devrait m'encourager à travailler pour m'assurer les petits extras dont je suis si friand."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "daecebf3-839c-4b0e-8f77-193efef3b73e",
                                "sense_id": "04cb02c0-71e6-3695-8d07-7c9faa4c7548",
                                "text": "les politiques \"touchent les jeunes qui sont très friands de la punchline et de l'éloquence présentes dans les contenus\"."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7c76e2d5-e40c-3d3c-afe2-eed60235f80c",
                        "entry_id": "00f75cd0-c992-3458-923d-164197e1988e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui est agréable à manger, qui est alléchant par sa délicatesse."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e698fe3c-e266-4f3d-96dc-d7434fc178c9",
                                "sense_id": "7c76e2d5-e40c-3d3c-afe2-eed60235f80c",
                                "text": "Morceau, mets friand."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3e5c014c-8a3d-4d1c-a7c3-d60449b73087",
                        "source_entry_id": "00f75cd0-c992-3458-923d-164197e1988e",
                        "target_lang_word": "fond of",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "afb4dd96-6032-449b-821c-03d690d02be7",
                        "source_entry_id": "00f75cd0-c992-3458-923d-164197e1988e",
                        "target_lang_word": "lover of",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c609164b-cd41-4393-b109-cc3fd527952d",
                        "source_entry_id": "00f75cd0-c992-3458-923d-164197e1988e",
                        "target_lang_word": "epicurean",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "epicurean",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3515eb4c-ac09-37fc-8065-6afe2e7d71e2",
                                        "entry_id": "c3a9eac0-9314-32e1-ab15-7903f7d52fb1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pursuing pleasure, especially in reference to food or comfort."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61aabf0c-6986-4e22-90fb-8ab2add4ee55",
                                                "sense_id": "3515eb4c-ac09-37fc-8065-6afe2e7d71e2",
                                                "text": "The powers of the Canadian voyageurs and hunters in the consumption of meat strike the greenhorn with wonder and astonishment; and are only equalled by the gastronomical capabilities exhibited by Indian dogs, both following the same plan in their epicurean gorgings."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51d89a87-0577-418e-9a7c-d4b5f1cbae12",
                                                "sense_id": "3515eb4c-ac09-37fc-8065-6afe2e7d71e2",
                                                "text": "Though a list of the great writers contain all the constituents of an Epicurean feast, yet to most of us it resembles the menu of a Gargantuan banquet."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "479f36e5-b827-36c5-b1d3-1dac80f919ed",
                                        "entry_id": "c3a9eac0-9314-32e1-ab15-7903f7d52fb1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Devoted to luxurious living."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "epicurean",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f26fac1b-ba16-36ce-a78e-0b501e320907",
                                        "entry_id": "4e5ef5a8-b721-317b-97d6-6a4b9c81f9ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who is devoted to pleasure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1e73260-c2b8-4331-897c-a9c42567b8e0",
                                                "sense_id": "f26fac1b-ba16-36ce-a78e-0b501e320907",
                                                "text": "I keep but a man and a maid, ever ready to slander and steal ; / I know it, and smile a hard-set smile, like a stoic, or like / A wiser epicurean, and let the world have its way."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09c394e6-ce5e-4dc1-9a57-5d6855686538",
                                                "sense_id": "f26fac1b-ba16-36ce-a78e-0b501e320907",
                                                "text": "Other eras have had their epicureans or hedonists, of course, who lived and sometimes died for the ideal of simplicity or pleasure in an epic kind of way. But today’s gazillion-strong influencer community has zero intellectual underpinning to it, which is why it’s so often the unwitting butt of its own joke."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "322800f7-9ff9-490e-b2de-4674c77b13d2",
                        "source_entry_id": "00f75cd0-c992-3458-923d-164197e1988e",
